                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s been said Biden\u2019s prostate cancer is \u2018hormone sensitive\u2019, it takes at least 5 weeks to figure this out with a medicine called Firmagon. So his original diagnosis was at the latest about 6 weeks ago.",
